1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,493
What does Govardhan Puja teach us?

2
00:00:02,493 --> 00:00:04,247
Who gives to us every day,

3
00:00:04,247 --> 00:00:06,203
without being asked? In Braj,

4
00:00:06,203 --> 00:00:07,620
Indra was worshipped.

5
00:00:07,750 --> 00:00:11,613
Little Krishna said: grass and water come from Govardhan,

6
00:00:11,613 --> 00:00:13,850
milk from our cows. Worship them.

7
00:00:14,240 --> 00:00:15,842
Indra felt insulted,

8
00:00:15,842 --> 00:00:19,126
and sent the clouds of pralaya. Cowherds,

9
00:00:19,126 --> 00:00:21,850
gopis, cows... all were trembling.

10
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:25,350
Everyone ran to Krishna: "Only you can save us now!"

11
00:00:26,150 --> 00:00:28,080
Playfully, with one hand,

12
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:30,937
Krishna lifted Govardhan. Seven days.

13
00:00:30,937 --> 00:00:33,640
Seven nights. Everyone stayed safe.

14
00:00:33,770 --> 00:00:35,789
At last Indra saw his mistake.

15
00:00:35,789 --> 00:00:38,211
The clouds parted, the sun came out.

16
00:00:38,211 --> 00:00:40,970
Indra came himself and asked forgiveness.

17
00:00:41,090 --> 00:00:43,830
That is why many homes offer the Annakut bhog.

18
00:00:44,730 --> 00:00:47,658
Now look around you: the air you breathe,

19
00:00:47,658 --> 00:00:49,943
the water you drink, daily milk,

20
00:00:49,943 --> 00:00:52,800
morning sun. Who gave all this, unasked?

21
00:00:52,930 --> 00:00:55,911
Do you see it now? Not puja, but thanks.

22
00:00:55,911 --> 00:00:58,371
What nature gives without asking,

23
00:00:58,371 --> 00:00:59,340
recognise it.

24
00:00:59,620 --> 00:01:02,640
Puja or no puja, learn to say thank you.

25
00:01:03,700 --> 00:01:05,137
Take a deep breath.

26
00:01:05,137 --> 00:01:07,632
This air too came without asking.

27
00:01:07,632 --> 00:01:09,900
In your heart, say: thank you.

28
00:01:10,010 --> 00:01:13,219
If you have thought of it and said thank you,

29
00:01:13,219 --> 00:01:15,928
then know this: your puja is complete!

30
00:01:15,928 --> 00:01:17,140
Jai Shri Krishna.

31
00:01:17,280 --> 00:01:21,150
Now comment in one word: what have you received most without asking?

